course: dictionary
lesson: 9944
title: Taro: a root you must cook
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: Taro is a plant that grows in hot, wet tropical places. Its big underground root is starchy, so it fills you up, and it is cooked and eaten like a potato. Its heart-shaped leaves can be cooked too.
explain: Use context to work out a new word. «Farming began separately in several places: wheat in the Middle East, rice in China, maize in Mexico, potatoes in the Andes, bananas and taro in New Guinea, sorghum in Africa.» Taro sits in a list of foods that people first grew on farms, so it must be a plant that people grow for food.
explain: Be careful with taro. Raw taro can make your mouth and throat sore, so it must always be cooked first. Taro can also mean the food made from the root, such as taro chips or taro bubble tea.
fact: Taro is a tropical plant grown for its large, starchy root.
fact: The root of taro is called a corm, and it is cooked and eaten like a potato.
fact: Taro is a staple food, an everyday main food, in the Pacific Islands, Asia and Africa.
fact: In Hawaii, taro is made into poi.
fact: Raw taro can irritate the mouth and throat, so always cook it.
exercise: In «bananas and taro in New Guinea», what kind of thing is taro? | A kind of rock | A type of bird | *A plant grown for food | A village in the mountains
exercise: Why must taro be cooked before you eat it? | *Raw taro can irritate your mouth and throat | Raw taro is too sweet | Cooking makes it bigger | It is only sold in tins
exercise: Which part of the taro plant is cooked like a potato? | The bark | The flowers | The seeds in the pods | *The root, called a corm
test: Taro bubble tea has a taro flavour. What does taro mean here? | *The food made from the taro root | A tropical storm | A kind of sweet | A kind of cup
test: In Hawaii, taro is made into which food? | Pasta | *Poi | Pickles | Pancakes
exam: Which sentence about taro is true? | Taro grows only in very cold places | *Taro is a starchy root that must be cooked before eating | Taro is a fruit that is always eaten raw | Taro is a kind of fish from the Pacific
